> Genuine original video and every held-out frame

Use the same original KTH24fit/6validation/6test clips as C3D and factorized
video:boxing0/handclapping1/handwaving2,scenario1,people1..4/5/6,first two
annotated segments per source video. Sixteen unique actual frames span each
original segment. FFmpeg only decodes;tensor Float32 legacy bilinear32px resize
and/255 produce model inputs. The original AVI/annotation mirror is pinned
to7076149bdbeff8d70003a68d6291fd080db44683 because the KTH server is unavailable.
All source hashes,frame identities and segment/person boundaries are retained.

```{cpp, flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
